        "html": "<div class=\"lap\">\n  <img class=\"lap-bg\" src=\"{{1}}\" alt=\"\">\n  <div class=\"lap-scr\"><img src=\"{{2}}\" alt=\"서울형 정원처방 메인 화면\"></div>\n</div>\n<style>\n  .lap { position: relative; aspect-ratio: 1328 / 747; overflow: hidden; }\n  .lap-bg { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }\n  .lap-scr { position: absolute; left: 29.443%; top: 24.632%; width: 41.114%; height: 45.917%; overflow: hidden; background: #fff; }\n  .lap-scr img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; animation: lapScroll 24s ease-in-out infinite; }\n  @keyframes lapScroll {\n    0%, 8% { transform: translateY(0); }\n    46%, 58% { transform: translateY(-74.7%); }\n    96%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }\n  }\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .lap-scr img { animation: none; } }\n</style>",
